  "details": "I am making a butler avatar and I'm trying to come up with a way to work with Phys bones to serve drinks. Examples here, I used a stretchy bone between the wrist and the glass. making it where people can grab the glass downside is it does not tilt when someone moves there wrist while grabbing the glass, it tilts with my own wrist. It would be great to somehow have a dedicated bone that will float back to dedicated location but allows people to grab and tilt and place where they want with a world limit or a length limit. also options to when you walk around with the drinks to not flop around like ears.",
